WEBVTT

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:08.250
Rachel D
Sunflower Express
-A Police Blotter in Love-
True Romance Books

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:16.250
Taninaka-san, there is no way she went
on a trip in search of a place to die.

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:28.540
Because the French marigolds she sent him mean
"always keep me with you" in the language of flowers.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.910
Then, she wasn't planning on dying, Poiron-sensei?!

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.000
Oui.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:39.700
My grey cells, which I inherited from
my grandfather, have begun to fire.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.290
I swear on the Poiron name...

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.160
I will solve this case!

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.200
There it is!

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:51.290
Yoshiko Yamamura Poiron's signature phrase! So cool!

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:55.370
Sunflower Express sure is a fun read,
no matter how many times I read it!

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:00.160
Hm?

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.370
Nyanko Big? Where are you?

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.540
He sure has been going out a lot lately...

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:23.700
Tada Coffee Shop

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:23.500
Big Bro! Wake up! It's urgent!

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:27.000
Huh? What's wrong?

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:30.870
It's Nyanko Big! Nyanko Big didn't come back home!

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.120
Huh?

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:45.700
Tada Never Falls in Love

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.080
Hey, look over here

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.500
The viewfinder is always set

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.910
If it isn't of you, then it doesn't appeal to me

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:59.080
Did something happen to me?

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:02.410
I walked past my friends

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:05.540
And my close friend, whom I keep missing

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:08.040
It's a turbulent world

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:12.410
By the time I realized it, the world was like a rainbow

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:15.830
Oh, seasons, stop

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:21.910
In the photos of our time together

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:27.330
Every single thing is shining brightly

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:33.410
Hey, there's one thing I want to tell you

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:40.500
I can't stop it or hide it anymore; that feeling is right here

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:48.750
Baby, before you vanish into this film we call "memories"

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:53.500
There's something I want to tell you

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.250
"I'm in love with you now"

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:08.950
It's Better Than Crying

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:15.250
Hey, Big Bro! Nyanko Big always gets back before
morning! He's never been out this long before!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.080
He didn't eat dinner, either.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.330
He didn't come back for dinner?

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.120
No.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:22.160
He's finally started dieting, too, huh?

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.620
But he's disappeared along with his girlfriend!

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:25.660
His girlfriend, too?

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.870
Seriously? Doesn't taking his girlfriend
with him mean that he ran away from home?

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.120
What?!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.620
Nyanko Big had a girlfriend?

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.790
He has a super thin girlfriend.

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:38.370
This is her.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:42.370
Whoa! It's a pretty tattered up foxtail!

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.830
That's because we bought it when he was a kitten.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:52.120
Ever since then, he'd always take it to sleep
with him, so we've been calling it his girlfriend.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.000
Uh-huh, uh-huh!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.250
It's a surreal girlfriend, huh?

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.370
He loved it so much that it's falling apart.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.040
Well, Nyanko Big's already ten years old, after all.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:01.950
He's ten years young!

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:02.700
Yui...

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:03.290
Huh?

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:09.660
For ages, it's been said that cats
suddenly go on a trip when they get older.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.040
A trip...?

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.410
There is no way she went on a trip
in search of a place to die.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:18.830
Give me a break, Grandpa!

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:23.540
Nyanko Big is still young!
He wouldn't run away from home or go on some trip!

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.450
Yui.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:29.290
He grew up with us ever since we were little...

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:33.620
I can't imagine Nyanko Big disappearing on us!

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:43.580
You're right!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.700
Sorry, Yui-chan! Nyanko Big would
never run away from home!

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.200
It's okay.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:51.700
What's okay?!

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:56.750
He was fine even when he fell from the second floor
and when he was drowning in the pond.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.950
Trepid Nyanko Big's name isn't just for show.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:02.540
Yeah...

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:10.200
That's right, Tada-senpai!
Yui-chan, let's look for Nyanko Big!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:15.120
I'm an animal lover, so if you're looking for a cat,
you can count on me! Let's find him together!

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.160
Yamashita-senpai...!

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:20.500
Animals don't like you, though.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.120
That's not true!

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:25.750
Mitsuyoshi, I can take care of the shop alone,
so go look for him.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:26.870
Grandpa...

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:29.750
Okay.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:33.370
Yamashita-kun, Kaoru-kun, thank you.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:34.500
No prob!

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:39.370
Tada Coffee Shop

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:39.370
Tada-senpai, got the pet carrier?

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:41.000
Got it.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.620
Yui-chan, got the catnip, food, and Girlfriend No. 2?

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:45.830
Got 'em!

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.790
Girlfriend No. 2 sure is pretty!

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:52.950
Okay. As for me and Ijuin-senpai,
we've got the laundry bag.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.000
A laundry bag?

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.290
Do we need that?

00:05:55.700 --> 00:06:00.660
If me and Ijuin-senpai try to catch him,
we'll definitely need this for Nyanko Big.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.500
It's Trepid Nyanko Big.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:09.080
Yeah, so by putting him in the bag and calming him
down, no one gets hurt. It's a happy method!

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:12.580
Just as I'd expect from a guy
who's disliked by all animals.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:12.580
Uh-huh, uh-huh!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:16.410
That's amazing, Yamashita-senpai! You know everything!

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:20.370
And you were about to cry about Nyanko Big
being gone just a moment ago.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.500
It's better than crying.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.290
Hmph!

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:25.040
Hm?

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.870
Huh? Teresa-chan! Alec!

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:32.540
Teresa-san!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.580
Have you seen Nyanko Big?!

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.200
Nyanko Big!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.910
Nyanko Big!

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.080
Come here!

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.410
I'm worried about Nyanko Big-san...

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.950
Oh, all right.

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:55.790
Huh?

00:06:56.120 --> 00:07:03.450
It is unbecoming of you to do nothing in this situation,
so let's tell Sir Charles that we'll be late.

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:06.700
Thank you, Alec!

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:10.370
Hmm... It doesn't seem like he's around here.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:13.450
Um, we'll help out.

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:16.410
Wow, thank you, Teresa-san!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.080
Thank you.

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.120
You're welcome!

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:21.580
I'll call you back when we find him.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:26.330
A cat's territory is larger than you'd expect.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:31.830
We'd have better luck finding him by splitting up,
if it turns out that he isn't nearby.

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:34.660
Okay! In that case...!

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:37.910
Do you need something, Ijuin?

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.160
Pin-senpai? Are you free right now?

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.540
I am free, I suppose.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.040
I'm here with the Class Rep to buy some clothes.

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:50.080
What?! Are you guys on a date?! A date?!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:51.750
No!

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:56.080
He said he was questioned by the police a few days ago,
so we just came to buy him ordinary clothes.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.870
That's not to say that I asked her to.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.620
It'd be bad if he was arrested on his way
to cram school, wouldn't it?

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:02.870
Well, that's true.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.660
It's tough being a conspicuous guy!

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:13.370
Ahem! Then, those present will look for him!

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.290
Okay!

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:17.040
Well then, we'll search over there.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:19.700
All righty, me and Mitsuyoshi will look there.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:20.500
Okay.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:22.660
Then, let's go, Yui-chan!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:23.910
O-okay!

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:29.870
We need to look for Nyanko Big right now! Love is a
no-no for detectives, Yui!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.120
Huh?

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.580
Okay, let's go!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:36.950
Yeah!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:41.660
My grey cells have begun to fire.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:47.580
I swear on my name...
I will solve this Nyanko Big disappearance case!

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:04.620
Nyanko Big! Nyanko Big!

00:09:00.750 --> 00:09:02.370
Nyanko Big!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.620
Nyanko Big!

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.870
Nyanko Big?

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:09.620
I've got kibbles!

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.080
Here's Girlfriend No. 2!

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.700
Yamashita-senpai, you sure find a lot of cats.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.250
It's 'cause I've got cat behaviors down pat.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:25.250
I loved books about animals ever since I was a kid,
and I read them a zillion times, too.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.700
Really?!

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:30.540
I guess they were sort of like your favorite mystery story.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:32.870
Yeah! Sunflower Express, right?!

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.500
Whoa! That was close!

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:43.410
This park is the perfect hangout for cats.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.790
Y-yeah!

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.000
Hey, girls!

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:55.160
You're cute! Have you seen this cat?

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.750
He's so cool!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:04.040
Hey, beautiful ladies, have you seen this cat?

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:06.540
He's so lovely!

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:11.040
We're not able to gather eyewitness
information that easily, huh?

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:14.120
Well... they wouldn't be able to tell with these photos.

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.160
Cotton Candy

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:25.540
Sorry to bother you. This cat's name is Nyanko Big-san.

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.910
Did you happen to see him around?

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.290
I don't think I've seen him.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.870
I see...

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:32.910
Here. Sorry for the wait!

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:34.910
I hope you find him soon.

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.540
I sincerely appreciate it!

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:37.500
Takoyaki

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:41.450
Miss Teresa, would you please stop buying things
while we're gathering information?

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.790
I'm sorry, I can't help it...

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.950
Where could Nyanko Big-san have gone?

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.000
It's okay. That cat has spunk.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:53.830
You're right.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.330
Allo, Teresa.

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.250
Charles!

00:11:01.250 --> 00:11:03.790
Are you okay? Is something wrong?

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:08.080
Well, actually, I'm looking for Nyanko Big-san.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:12.000
Nyanko Big? If you're looking for him,
I saw him last night.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.700
You did?! Where?!

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:15.830
Where? It was...

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:25.790
Nyanko Big?

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.120
Let me help you there, Nyanko Big.

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:35.700
Are you okay?

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:42.120
That's important to you, isn't it?

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.290
Whoa! Okay, I get it!

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:53.450
That's right. Someone once told me,
"if you give up, then that's that," too.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:56.910
Okay, here you go.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.790
Right, right. This is it.

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.290
Nyanko Big was here, right?

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:09.370
Yeah. He was here last night.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.910
He went in that direction afterwards.

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.200
That isn't the way home...

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.200
Yeah.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.580
Shall I ask her?

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:20.870
Huh?!

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.950
Bonjour, Mademoiselle.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:27.410
Huh? This has gotta be a French joke, right?

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.040
Merci.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:31.540
She said she saw him at the flower shop over there.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:32.580
What?!

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:33.750
You can talk to cats?!

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:38.660
The flower shop over there? Could it be...?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.040
Isn't it this place?

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:44.580
Th-this place?

00:12:45.250 --> 00:12:46.910
Hey! Nyanko Big!

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:48.160
You're right!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:55.040
Thank goodness! Geez, why didn't you come home?!
Come here, Nyanko Big!

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:56.660
Here's some kibbles!

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:58.290
Here's catnip.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.200
Here's Girlfriend No. 2!

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:02.370
Here's a laundry bag!

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:06.750
What's wrong, Nyanko Big?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:08.790
Charles-san!

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.540
Is there something wrong, Nyanko Big?

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:17.540
He doesn't seem to want to say.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.500
I can tell that much, too.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:24.620
Nyanko Big! If you've got a reason
for running away from home, I'm all ears.

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:28.160
I said he didn't run away from home!
I'm sure he has his reasons!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.620
Maybe he can't get down.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:35.540
Yeah...

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:38.870
Anyway, I'll ask the shopkeeper
if they'll let me go up there.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.540
Sunflower...!

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:47.830
French marigolds mean "always keep me with you"
in the language of flowers.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:51.830
Then, she wasn't planning on dying, Poiron-sensei?!

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:56.200
My grey cells have begun to fire.

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.580
Yui-chan...?

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.620
What does a sunflower mean in the language of flowers?

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.000
I only have eyes for you.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:10.830
You are correct, Alec-san!
In other words, Nyanko Big is in love!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:11.830
Huh?

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:12.910
I see!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.540
But there are plenty of other flowers around!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.370
Yeah.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.370
Eeep!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.120
Love...?

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.500
Hair Salon
Mairu

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:29.500
Cherry-chan?

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:30.250
Huh?

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.160
Cherry?

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:32.080
Cherry?

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.950
Cherry-chan! Wait, who's that again?

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.330
Oh! Is that her?!

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:39.330
He likes her, huh?!

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:41.250
There's no doubt about it!

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.950
Nyanko Big! Hold still!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.250
Hold on! Wait!

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:52.910
Don't do it!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.290
I told you to hold still!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.000
Nyanko Big!

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.500
Nyanko Big!

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:16.950
Nyanko Big! Geez! I was worried sick!

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.120
Is your kitty okay?

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:22.330
Ah, yes! He's okay!

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:24.080
Thank goodness!

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:26.500
I've been seeing him a lot lately.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:31.000
He'd been sitting over there since this morning,
so I was getting a little concerned.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:34.120
I'm sorry my cat caused a stir.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:35.500
Chia-nee.

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.200
Huh? Kentaro?

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.660
Are these your friends?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:45.540
These are my high school senpai and Nyanko Big.
He disappeared, so we were looking for him.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.160
Oh, really?

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:50.160
I'm surprised that he was coming here to see Cherry!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:51.700
And it's at your place, Chia-nee.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.330
What a total coincidence!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.330
I'm surprised you guys figured out where he was!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:59.080
Hey, why did you run away with your girlfriend in tow?

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:00.950
Huh?

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:02.040
I see.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:06.040
He said he thought about giving her the foxtail,
his most prized possession.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:08.540
Nyanko Big, you little rascal!

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:14.830
Oh... Well, good luck, Nyanko-kun.

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.790
I'm going to head back in.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:20.540
Oh! You grew taller, huh? Stop by again for a haircut.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.450
Okay!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.580
See you around!

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:33.950
Could she be the one he has a one-sided love with?

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:35.620
Hey!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.500
So, the Nyanko Big case was solved
without any problems.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.200
Yeah.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.500
Y-yeah!

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:51.120
Let's go, Nyanko Big.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.120
Yui-chan...

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:03.580
We solved the case, but it isn't a happy ending.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:12.370
Hashimaki

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:12.200
Have you ever fallen in love, Tada-kun?

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:15.450
Huh? No, never.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.080
I see.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:21.250
My charm is so incredible that I can't...

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:22.450
Right...

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:26.330
How about you, Charles?
Do you have a girlfriend or someone you like?

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:27.370
Well...

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:31.250
You found him? Glad to hear that!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:38.700
There's someone I like very much.
But it's difficult to get someone you like to like you back.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.370
I bought some takoyaki!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.330
Thanks!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:47.330
I sincerely appreciate it.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.500
You sincerely appreciate it?

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.040
It's rubbed off on you.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:53.870
Shaved Ice

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:00.160
Huh?

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.580
Takoyaki

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:03.120
I'm glad we found Nyanko Big.

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:13.120
Hot! So good!

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:18.910
That lady we saw earlier... She was lovely.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:19.790
Yeah.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:25.910
Yamashita-senpai... do you like her?

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.000
I do.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:32.870
But she's always seen me just as a little brother,
so she doesn't see me as a man.

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.330
Are you okay with that?

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:43.290
I can't act as if my crush on her never happened, so...

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:50.620
I'm just happy to see Chia-nee smiling for me.

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.950
I'm stupid, aren't I?

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.700
We didn't disrupt your plans, did we?

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.870
Tada Coffee Shop

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:07.000
No, we can go shopping at any time.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:09.040
Thank you. See ya.

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:09.950
Okay.

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:14.000
Are you all right, Yui-chan?

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:21.500
Teresa-san...

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:30.750
I didn't know that falling in love
with someone could be so painful!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:44.410
I don't want to be happy with just seeing him smile!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.750
I want to hold his hand if he's with me!

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:49.450
I want to talk to him!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.290
I want to do all sorts of things with him!

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:04.500
These sunflowers sure are pretty!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:05.750
I know, right?

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.750
"I only have eyes for you"...

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:09.700
Yeah!

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.700
Thank you very much.

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:15.370
Huh?

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:16.500
Huh?

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:19.410
Are you going again, Nyanko Big?

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:23.370
We're in the same boat, aren't we?

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:28.870
Take care! But be sure to come home
before the end of the day!

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.910
I won't give you food, if you don't!

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:54.580
I kept wondering how long this would last

00:20:55.330 --> 00:21:05.830
I had no idea why you were so pretty that day

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:12.160
After taking you away, someone who calls himself "God"

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:18.040
Says that I will never see you again

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:23.660
Where are you going? There was nothing I could do

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:28.700
You beautiful person

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:35.160
I miss you so much

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:40.790
If one of my wishes were to come true

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:46.750
I would want to hold you tight right now

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:52.410
I only wanted to be with you forever

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:57.580
Within my heart is a melody of a flood of tears

00:21:57.580 --> 00:22:06.250
I can't ever forget the days I spent with you

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.290
Huh?

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:21.160
Oh! Nyanko Big! Are you going to work today, too?

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:27.040
If you give up, then that's that, okay?

00:22:28.620 --> 00:22:31.370
You're asking me who told me that?

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:37.000
That's enough, Teresa.
Searching any further won't make a difference!

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:37.950
No!

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.660
It's important to you, right?!

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:42.700
If you give up, then that's that!

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:44.450
Okay...

00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:45.200
Ah!

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:53.500
I found it! I found it, I found it! I found it, Charles!

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:57.580
That smile of hers was captivating.

00:22:58.120 --> 00:23:01.910
That was the moment when I truly fell in love.

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:07.950
Just kidding! Did you believe me, Nyanko Big?

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:22.000
It seems the words you've hidden deep within
your heart inadvertently spill out on a moonlit night,

00:23:22.500 --> 00:23:23.580
so be careful.

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:28.500
What happened to Nyanko Big after that?

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:31.120
I heard that he visits Cherry every day.

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:33.120
I hope his devotion gets across to her.

00:23:33.750 --> 00:23:37.040
Also, next time: Episode 8, "Were You the Rain-bringer?"

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:41.000
Were You the Rain-bringer?

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:38.500
That's what he asked, Alec.

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:39.540
No, I'm not.

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:40.870
Please look forward to it.
